### Listar produtos
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/products
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Novo produto (form)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/products/new
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Criar produto
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/products
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Consultoria Trabalhista&description=Consultoria em direito trabalhista&keywords=trabalhista,CLT,rescisão,FGTS

### Editar produto (form)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}/edit
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Atualizar produto
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Consultoria Trabalhista&description=Atualizado&keywords=trabalhista,CLT,rescisão,FGTS,hora extra

### Toggle ativo/inativo
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}/toggle
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Vincular funil
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}/funnels
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

funnel_id={{funnel_id}}&priority=10

### Desvincular funil
DELETE {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}/funnels/{{funnel_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Alterar prioridade
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/products/{{product_id}}/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/priority
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

priority=20

### Associar produto a lead
PUT {{base_url}}/tenant/leads/{{lead_id}}/product
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

product_id={{product_id}}
